  "description": "All Sangwoo wanted was big money, but boy, was that a big mistake. Now on the run from gangsters, Sangwoo and his gorgeous wife, Seran, have to find shelter. Luckily for them, Seran’s friend is out of the country and her house is all theirs to use. The couple have no time to lose, so off they go. Their final destination? Pound Town! Who knows what’ll they’ll find there...\n\n(Source: Lezhin X)",
